Financial data sources differ in provenance, coverage, timeliness, definitions, and permitted uses.|A vendor licence allows internal analysis but not public redistribution.|Paid access automatically permits website publication?|No|Yes|Only for charts
Cleaning checks types, dates, missingness, duplicates, units, and reconciliations without hiding economic events.|₹ crore and ₹ lakh figures create an apparent mismatch.|First investigate…?|Units and source definitions|Only rounding|Only colour formatting
Corporate-action adjustments account for splits and relevant distributions using a specified return convention.|A two-for-one split halves raw price without halving owner wealth.|Raw price decline here equals a 50% economic loss?|No|Yes|Only for indices
Point-in-time data uses information actually available then; survivor-only samples omit failures.|A backtest includes only today's surviving companies.|This creates…?|Survivorship bias|Guaranteed conservative returns|No selection issue
Spreadsheet engineering structures formulas, inputs, checks, versioning, and documentation.|A formula silently changes reference after copying.|A useful control is…?|Independent reconciliation and formula review|Only cell colouring|Only password protection
SQL queries structured data; Python and R support analysis and modelling; tool choice follows reproducibility needs.|A join duplicates rows and inflates revenue.|First check…?|Join keys and data grain|Only software brand|Only chart labels
APIs and pipelines automate extraction and transformation with schema, timestamp, and failure controls.|A provider changes a field's units without changing its name.|A robust pipeline needs…?|Validation and change detection|Only repeated downloads|Only faster hardware
Econometrics models relationships with identification and error assumptions; forecasting tests predictive use.|A model fits history but fails after a regime change.|In-sample fit proves forecast reliability?|No|Yes|Only with high R²
Factor research tests exposures and strategies using point-in-time universes, costs, and independent evaluation.|A value factor looks profitable before turnover costs.|Use…?|Net out-of-sample evidence|Only gross return|Only the best period
Look-ahead uses future information; overfitting learns noise; data snooping selects lucky results among many tests.|Choose the best of 1,000 strategies on the same sample.|The winning result is likely affected by…?|Selection bias|Guaranteed skill|Only currency conversion
Realistic backtests include fees, spreads, impact, turnover, capacity, and feasible fills.|A small gross edge disappears after trading costs.|The strategy's investable result is…?|Net performance|Gross return alone|Signal accuracy alone
Monte Carlo samples outcomes from specified distributions and dependencies.|Changing correlation assumptions changes simulated portfolio losses.|More simulations fix incorrect assumptions?|No|Yes|Only above one million
Numerical methods approximate prices and optimal choices; convergence and stability require checks.|A derivative price changes materially when time-step size is halved.|This suggests…?|Numerical convergence needs review|Guaranteed accuracy|No model issue
Algorithmic execution manages order placement; systematic investing applies repeatable decision rules.|A signal is profitable theoretically but cannot trade its assumed volume.|The missing consideration is…?|Execution and capacity|Only signal naming|Only accounting EPS
ML learns patterns for credit, fraud, or forecasts; validation must address drift, imbalance, fairness, and leakage.|High accuracy on rare fraud events can come from predicting no fraud.|Accuracy alone is sufficient?|No|Yes|Only for AI
NLP extracts information from disclosures; context, negation, tables, and document timing affect validity.|A model mistakes a risk disclosure for an actual loss.|Needed safeguard?|Source-context verification|Only longer summaries|Only word counts
AI-assisted research can accelerate drafting and modelling but may invent facts, sources, or formulas.|An assistant supplies a plausible citation absent from the filing.|Best response?|Verify against primary evidence|Accept confident wording|Use it if concise
Reproducibility records inputs, code, versions, assumptions, and approvals; governance preserves accountable review.|Two analysts rerun the same dated inputs and documented process.|Human verification is replaced by reproducibility automatically?|No|Yes|Only with audited code
